Package: HangmanneR
Title: Play Hangman with CRAN Package Names
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matias", "Andina", , "matiasandina@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A Shiny game of hangman played with CRAN package names. Letters
    are guessed one at a time to uncover a package sampled from a snapshot of
    CRAN metadata that ships with the package. Difficulty is set by the length
    of the package name, play can be restricted to packages authored by Posit
    Software, PBC, and the package description is available as a hint with the
    name redacted.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
